Hi Andrew, 1.- Are you actually using version 2. 0 of Moodle on your site? That is now really considered a "beta" version, is no longer maintained, and you should must really upgrade to a more current version ASAP. 2.- From your description it is hard to understand what kind of development you have made. Using the Assignment activity looks like the obvious solution if you want an "essay" kind of activity, to be graded by teachers/tutors. Why not use that activity? 3.- Now, re that coding error message, it is telling you that in the "development" you have created, you forgot to take care of the message providers. In the current Lesson module, that is located in mod/lesson/db/messages.php, and consists of the following lines: 
```text
$messageproviders = array (


    // essay graded notification


    'graded_essay' => array (


    )


);
```
 Again, it's difficult to help if you do not provide more technical details about your development. I suggest you post further (technical) questions to the General developer forum . Joseph

